    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, it feels like more than just \"pain\" though. it feels like a fact. i saw someone's life change because i was too much of a coward to step in. how can anyone say there's anything \"good\" inside me when that's all i've actually done? i just feel like i'm taking up space that someone better could be using. someone who actually has a spine. someone who isn't just... empty.",
