      "content": "it just feels like a lie. all this talk about \"growth\" and \"scars\" feels like just more words to keep me tethered to something i don't even want to be part of anymore. how do you know that isn't just a way to avoid the truth? some people are just broken. some things can't be \"untangled\" or fixed. i feel like i'm just an error in the system. like i'm just consuming resources and oxygen that i haven't earned.",
